  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom space with the custom sports-themed bedding set from Jeminise. This custom bedding features a vintage football design with a football player flag pattern, offering a soft feel and a layer of breathable warmth that is perfect for football players, fans, and sports lovers.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customization options support up to 2 text inputs for personalized name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric with microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Lightweight &amp; Durable:</strong> Lightweight material with smooth, fine, and compact stitching along the edges for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Package includes 1 Duvet Cover or Comforter with optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, air dry without heat, or tumble dry on low heat.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Vintage Football Player Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football Player Flag Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Full, King, Queen, Twin</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
